// Detection: <Rule name: what it detects in one line>
// Playbook: playbooks/<scenario>/README.md
// Severity: <Low/Medium/High> | Frequency: <1h / 3h / 12h / 24h / NRT> | MITRE: <T####.###>
// Entities: <User = AccountObjectId | Device = DeviceId | Mailbox = RecipientEmailAddress | IP = IPAddress>
// Tuning: <known false positives and the variable to adjust>
// Status: Untested
//
// Rules for custom detections:
//  - Output must include Timestamp and ReportId (and DeviceId for Device* tables)
//  - Match ago() to the frequency: 1h -> ago(4h), 3h -> ago(12h), 12h -> ago(48h), 24h -> up to ago(30d)
//  - If you summarize, keep Timestamp and ReportId with arg_max(Timestamp, ReportId, ...)
let excluded = dynamic([]);
<Table>
| where Timestamp > ago(4h)
| where <condition>
| project Timestamp, ReportId, <entity columns>, <context columns>
